<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Felemon</book>
  <para style="h">Felemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Felemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Felemon</para>
  <para style="mt">Felemon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kri Jesu pongah thongim krah, Pawl hoi aicae amnawk Timote mah, a palung o ih, tok nawnto sah ampui Filemon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a palung o ih tanuh Apphia, aicae hoi misa nawnto tuh Arkhipa hoi na im ah amkhueng kricaanawk khaeah ca tarik:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Angraeng Jesu Kri hoi aicae Ampa Sithaw khae hoi ih tahmenhaih hoi monghaih to nangcae khaeah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Angraeng, Jesu tanghaih na tawnh moe, kaciim kaminawk boih to na palung ti, tiah ka thaih naah, ka Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lawk ka thuih toepsoep;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu Kri ah na tawnh ih kahoih hmuennawk boih na panoekhaih rang hoiah, minawk khaeah tanghaih kawng na thuih naah caak o thai tangtang hanah lawk ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kam nawk, kaciim kaminawk ih palungthin to nang thasak let pongah, to baktih nam lunghaih mah kaicae han thuilaek ai anghoehaih to ang paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To pongah ni Kri ah misa ka hoih parai moe, na sak han koi kahoih hmuen to sak hanah, lok kang thuih thaih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />toe saning kacoeh, Jesu Kri ih thongkrah kami ah kaom kai Pawl mah, amlunghaih hoiah ni tahmenhaih kang hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thongim krak nathung ka capa ah sak ih, Onesima hanah tahmenhaih kang hnik pae:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />anih loe canghniah nang han avanghaih om ai, toe vaihi loe nang hoi kai hanah atho kaom kami ah oh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anih to nang khaeah kang patoeh let: anih to kai thung hoi tacawt kami baktih toengah talawk ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />kahoih tamthanglok ka thuih pongah thongim ka krak naah kai khetzawn hanah, nang zuengah anih to kaimah khaeah ohsak han ka koeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />toe nang bomhaih loe tha hoiah saksak nganga ih baktiah om ai ah, na sak koehhaih palungthin hoiah saksak han ih ni kang koeh haih, to pongah nang naakrakhaih om ai ah loe tidoeh sak han ka koeh ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anih hoi nawnto dungzan ah na oh han ih kalang mue, anih mah nawnetta thung ang cawnhtaak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toe anih loe vaihi tamna ah om ai boeh, tamna pongah sang boeh, kai hanah loe palung ih kam nawk baktiah ni oh, nang han cae loe taksa hoi Angraeng ah kawkruk maw palung ih amnawk baktiah om aep tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kai hae toksah ampui ah na poek nahaeloe, anih doeh kai baktih toengah talawk ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang khaeah hmuen sakpazaehaih maw, pathok han koi laiba maw om nahaeloe, kai taham ah suem ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai, Pawl mah kaimah ih ban hoi roe ca kang tarik: toe kaimah kang rong pae han, na hinghaih ah kai khae laiba na tawnh, tiah kang thuih han angai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ue, kam nawk, Angraeng ah anghoehaih na paek ah: Angraeng ah kai ih palungthin to angthasak ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lok nang tahngai pae tih, tiah oephaih ka tawnh, to khue ai kang hnik ih hmuen pongah doeh kapop kueah na sah tih, tiah panoekhaih hoiah ni ca kang tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toe pacoengah, ka toemh han ih ahmuen to paroep coek ah: lawk na thuih o haih rang hoiah nangcae khaeah kang zo thai tih, tiah ka poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah kai hoi nawnto thongim krah Epaphra mah ban ang sin o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tok nawnto sah kami Marka, Aristarka, Dema hoi Luka cae mah doeh ban ang sin o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih loe nangcae ih muithla hoi nawnto om nasoe.
  </para>
</usx>
